Classes: [[Shadow Knight]]

Level requirement: 9

Reuse: 15 seconds

Autoskill: Yes

This ability reaves your current target, dealing physical damage as well as converting 6% (rounded down) of your maximum hit points into amplified magic damage.

Reave can [[Double Attack|Double]] and [[Triple Attack]].

Reave also reduces the [[Harm Touch]] cooldown by 60 seconds every time it lands, including the extra hits from double and triple attack.

Macro command: <code>/doability Reave</code>

Skill Cap: 210 at level 50.

